# sdist 里带上「不是包、但发布/复现需要」的东西：文档、手册、agent skill、样例产物、测试与夹具、扩展骨架、CI 配置。
# wheel 只装 run_2d_magnet.py + scripts/（见 pyproject.toml 的 py-modules / packages），
# 文档与样例随 sdist 和 Git 仓库分发 —— 这正是「clone 有、sdist 没有」这类发布事故的来源。
include README.md
include LICENSE
include requirements.txt
include pyproject.toml
include MANIFEST.in
include *.md
# 机器可读的能力边界：不在 wheel 里（wheel 只装 run_2d_magnet.py + scripts/），必须进 sdist
include capabilities.json
# 机器可读的引用信息（releases 页面/仓库识别用；不参与运行）
include CITATION.cff
recursive-include dsh *
recursive-include examples *
recursive-include tests *
recursive-include templates *
recursive-include .github *
global-exclude __pycache__/*
global-exclude *.pyc
global-exclude *.pyo
# 编辑器/笔记软件的工作区缓存（把仓库当 Obsidian vault 打开时会生成）
prune .obsidian
global-exclude .obsidian/*
global-exclude .trash/*
